  "bodyHash": "9e0abd36b4f23933",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Brand New Day 是一個客戶端模組，會在每天開始時顯示一個畫面。該畫面會顯示動畫日數計數器以及玩家當天所完成事項的統計資料。這提供了夜間到日間的美麗過渡，也是輕鬆追蹤遊戲天數的便捷方式。<br><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">目前顯示的統計資料包括：</span><br>破壞方塊數、移動距離、死亡次數、製作物品數與擊殺怪物數。<br><br>所有統計項目均可在設定檔中啟用或停用。預設顯示於畫面頂部的標題圖片（太陽與貓咪）也可在 <em>./config/brandnewday/header/</em> 資料夾中更換。<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showHeader</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在新的一天畫面頂部顯示標題圖片。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDayCount</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在新的一天畫面上顯示當前天數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showStats</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否顯示前一天的摘要。下方的每一行皆可個別切換顯示。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>playSound</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當新的一天畫面出現時是否播放音效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>newDayScreenDurationTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 200, min 1, max 1200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">新的一天畫面總共停留的刻數。20 刻 = 1 秒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>newDayScreenFadeInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 20, min 1, max 200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">畫面淡入所需的刻數。20 刻 = 1 秒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>newDayScreenFadeOutTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 20, min 1, max 200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">畫面消失前淡出所需的刻數。20 刻 = 1 秒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>guiScaleModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 1.0f, min 0.1, max 5.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">根據玩家的介面比例調整天數、統計文字與標題圖片的整體大小。1.0 對應介面比例 4 時的設定大小；數值越高，所有元素越大。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>headerImageWidth</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 64, min 0, max 2000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">標題圖片在螢幕上渲染的寬度（像素）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>headerImageHeight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 64, min 0, max 2000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">標題圖片在螢幕上渲染的高度（像素）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>headerImageYOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 10, min 0, max 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">標題圖片從螢幕頂部向下繪製的距離（像素）。設為 0 表示緊貼頂部。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dayFontScale</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 3, min 1, max 8</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">天數文字的放大倍率。1 為正常字體大小。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dayTextRGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 218, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">天數文字的紅色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dayTextRGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 164, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">天數文字的綠色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dayTextRGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 40, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">天數文字的藍色 RGB 值。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showMobsKilled</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在當日摘要中顯示擊殺怪物數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showBlocksBroken</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在當日摘要中顯示破壞方塊數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDistanceTraveled</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在當日摘要中顯示移動距離。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDeaths</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在當日摘要中顯示死亡次數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showItemsCrafted</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在當日摘要中顯示製作物品數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>statsKeyTextRGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 216, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">統計標籤（鍵名文字）的紅色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>statsKeyTextRGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 196, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">統計標籤（鍵名文字）的綠色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>statsKeyTextRGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 180, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">統計標籤（鍵名文字）的藍色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>statsValueTextRGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">統計數值（數字）的紅色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>statsValueTextRGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 234, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">統計數值（數字）的綠色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>statsValueTextRGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 210, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">統計數值（數字）的藍色 RGB 值。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>/brandnewday preview</em> - 預覽新的一天畫面。設定時非常實用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>/brandnewday last</em> - 再次顯示上一次的新的一天畫面。適用於畫面消失得太快的情况。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>畫面本身：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/brand-new-day/a.png\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>您可以在這裡看到畫面及其動畫日數計數器：</strong></span><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/brand-new-day/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"340\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在多個獨立的模組頁面中同時追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 提出。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
